```suggestion
    var allHeaders = new ImmutableMap.Builder<URI, Map<String, List<String>>>()
```

This is fine functionally, just a few suggestions on code style. Similar changes can be applied below as well.

```suggestion
    ImmutableMap.Builder<URI, Map<String, List<String>>> headers =
        ImmutableMap.builderWithExpectedSize(auth.size());
    for (var entry : auth.entrySet()) {
      try {
        headers.put(new URL(entry.getKey()).toURI(), entry.getValue());
      } catch (MalformedURLException e) {
        throw new RepositoryFunctionException(e, Transience.PERSISTENT);
      } catch (URISyntaxException e) {
        throw new EvalException(e);
      }
    }
```

